{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『すべての犬は天国へ行く』\n観てきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすごかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして面白かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが生ドルで\n何回か見た方がいいって言ってたけど\n確かに！と思った(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと難しいからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもキャラクターがはっきりしてて\nすんなり入ってきたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ役にあってて\n見てて本当に楽しかった＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に行けて良かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな初日お疲れさま！\n公演数たくさんあるけどがんばれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パナソニック充電池\n「乃木坂46応援力チャージプロジェクト」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://panasonic.jp/battery/charge/nogizaka46/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに\n撮影に参加させてもらってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、えりかさま、生駒ちゃん、飛鳥、ひめたん、中田\nの6人の中に中田がいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぅぅぅぅうううううういえええぇぇぇぇええええい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はペンライトめっちゃ使うし\n充電池のありがたみも\nみんなよりわかってるので\n本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12thシングルの制服着てますけど\n中田は普段大人メンバーの方を着てるのに\n若いメンバーのを着てる写メが\n何回か送られてきて\n「ん？なんで中田こっちの衣装着てるんだ？」\nって思ってた方いましたけど\nこの撮影で着たんですね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由は単純に統一感ですね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"限定ムービーや\nライブが当たるキャンペーンもあるので\n是非チェックしてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニット名思いつきました？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}